<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="36103064"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445049977"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="衝動"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HaKU"/><amll:meta key="album" value="衝動"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:45.560"><div begin="00:00.000" end="03:24.451"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:06.233" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">近づいて気付いてよ 恋の衝動<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xi ： cuji mula yuu ki</span></p><p begin="00:06.233" end="00:12.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Ah baby 抱きしめて連れ出して今すぐに</p><p begin="00:12.817" end="00:15.563" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">奪い去ってよ</p><p begin="00:15.563" end="00:35.185" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">昨日よりも君のこと知りたい</p><p begin="00:35.185" end="00:41.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">知りたいなら目を逸らさないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想了解的话就不要移开视线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">xi li ta i na la me wo so la sa na i de</span></p><p begin="00:41.928" end="00:45.329" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">君のその手で触れてほしいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想你能伸出手温柔碰触我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no so no te de fu re te ho xi i yo</span></p><p begin="00:45.329" end="00:48.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">気付いてほしくて鼓動が高まる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想你能察觉我加速的心跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu i te ho xi ku te ko dou ga ta ka ma lu</span></p><p begin="00:48.666" end="00:52.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">吐息交じりの魔法の言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">混杂你我魅惑靡息的魔咒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to iki ma ji li no ma hou no koto ba</span></p><p begin="00:52.074" end="00:55.515" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">囁くような愛のしらべ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如低吟浅唱的爱情咏调</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa sa ya ku yo u na ai no xila be</span></p><p begin="00:55.515" end="01:00.113" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">近づいて気付いてよ 恋の衝動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再靠近些快察觉到恋爱的冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">qika zu i te ki zu i te yo koi no xiyou dou</span></p><p begin="01:00.113" end="01:06.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Ah baby 抱きしめて連れ出して今すぐに</p><p begin="01:06.710" end="01:09.415" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">奪い去ってよ</p><p begin="01:09.415" end="01:12.598" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Touch me 閉じ込められてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">触摸我 历经长久的桎梏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Touch me to ji ko me la re te lu</span></p><p begin="01:12.598" end="01:15.496" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Kiss me 溢れてる感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲吻我 源源漫溢的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Kiss me afu re te lu kan jiyou</span></p><p begin="01:15.496" end="01:19.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">始まりの口づけでとろけたいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想用最初的吻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">haji ma li no kuqi zu ke de to lo ke ta i yo</span></p><p begin="01:19.571" end="01:21.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">恋の衝動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">融化这恋爱冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">koi no xiyou dou</span></p><p begin="01:28.937" end="01:35.699" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">君の全てさらけ出してほしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你能毫无保留展现所有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no sube te sala ke da xi te ho xi i</span></p><p begin="01:35.699" end="01:42.411" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">焦らすくらいがあなたは好きでしょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忍耐的煎熬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji la su gu la i ga</span></p><p begin="01:42.411" end="01:45.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">君のその瞳で見つめてほしいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想你的双眼只注视我一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no so no me de mi cu me te ho xi i yo</span></p><p begin="01:45.860" end="01:49.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">呼吸が止まって鼓動が聞こえる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">屏息凝神心跳渐渐传入耳畔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko kiyuu ga to ma te ko dou ga ki ko e lu</span></p><p begin="01:49.179" end="01:52.249" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">吐息交じりの魔法の言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">混杂你我魅惑靡息的魔咒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to iki ma ji li no ma hou no koto ba</span></p><p begin="01:52.249" end="01:55.831" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">囁くような愛のしらべ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如低吟浅唱的爱情咏调</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa sa ya ku yo u na ai no xila be</span></p><p begin="01:55.831" end="02:00.804" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">見えなくて見えそうなこの距離が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不时隐现的你我间的距离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e na ku te mi e so u na ko no kiyo li ga</span></p><p begin="02:00.804" end="02:07.354" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Ah baby 知りたくて触れたくて抑えきれない</p><p begin="02:07.354" end="02:09.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">二人の Everyday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你和我的每一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta li no everyday</span></p><p begin="02:09.834" end="02:12.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Touch me 閉じ込められてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">触摸我 历经长久的桎梏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Touch me to ji ko me la re te lu</span></p><p begin="02:12.984" end="02:16.268" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Take me モノクロの感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我走 黑白无色的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Take me mo no ku lo no kan jiyou</span></p><p begin="02:16.268" end="02:19.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">始まりの口づけで鮮やかに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就用最初的吻来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">haji ma li no kuqi zu ke de aza ya ka ni</span></p><p begin="02:19.916" end="02:22.197" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">色をつけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">染上一抹绚彩斑斓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ilo wo cu ke te</span></p><p begin="02:29.127" end="02:32.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">君のその手で触れてほしいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想你能伸出手温柔碰触我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no so no te de fu re te ho xi i yo</span></p><p begin="02:32.611" end="02:36.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">気付いてほしくて鼓動が高まる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想你能察觉我加速的心跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu i te ho xi ku te ko dou ga ta ka ma lu</span></p><p begin="02:36.092" end="02:39.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">吐息交じりの魔法の言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">混杂你我魅惑靡息的魔咒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to iki ma ji li no ma hou no koto ba</span></p><p begin="02:39.340" end="02:42.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">囁くような愛のしらべ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如低吟浅唱的爱情咏调</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa sa ya ku yo u na ai no xila be</span></p><p begin="02:42.783" end="02:49.474" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">近づいて気付いてよ 恋の衝動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再靠近些快察觉到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">qika zu i te ki zu i te yo</span></p><p begin="02:49.474" end="02:53.954" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">抱きしめて連れ出して今すぐに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抱紧我带我走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki xi me te cu re da xi te</span></p><p begin="02:53.954" end="03:02.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Ah baby 近づいて気付いてよ 恋の衝動</p><p begin="03:02.620" end="03:09.635" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Ah baby 抱きしめて連れ出して今すぐに</p><p begin="03:09.635" end="03:11.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">奪い去ってよ</p><p begin="03:11.834" end="03:15.099" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Touch me 閉じ込められてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">触摸我 历经长久的桎梏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Touch me to ji ko me la re te lu</span></p><p begin="03:15.099" end="03:18.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Kiss me 溢れてる感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲吻我 源源漫溢的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Kiss me afu re te lu kan jiyou</span></p><p begin="03:18.110" end="03:22.456" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">始まりの口づけでとろけたいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想用最初的吻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">haji ma li no kuqi zu ke de to lo ke ta i yo</span></p><p begin="03:22.456" end="03:24.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">恋の衝動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">融化这恋爱冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">koi no xiyou dou</span></p></div></body></tt>